  4: { keywords: "Structure · Discipline · Practicality", text: "Traditionally linked with building steadily, reliability and attention to detail. The shadow side is rigidity or resisting change." },
  5: { keywords: "Freedom · Change · Curiosity", text: "Traditionally linked with adaptability, travel and variety. The shadow side is restlessness or difficulty committing." },
